<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:37.53296%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="Ryan R. Campbell and his wife pose for a picture at Playa Sandy Beach in Rincón, Puerto Rico." data-height="1800" data-id="10096" data-link="https://ryanrcampbell.com/ef434b66-8f1b-4c42-8600-134d037bc639/" data-url="https://ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/EF434B66-8F1B-4C42-8600-134D037BC639-819x1024.jpg" data-width="1440" src="https://i1.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/EF434B66-8F1B-4C42-8600-134D037BC639-819x1024.jpg?ssl=1" data-amp-layout="responsive"/></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:62.46704%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="A row of chairs overlook a drop-off to the sea, where the sun sets on the horizon." data-height="2853" data-id="10095" data-link="https://ryanrcampbell.com/img_6235/" data-url="https://ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6235-1024x768.jpg" data-width="3804" src="https://i1.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6235-1024x768.jpg?ssl=1" data-amp-layout="responsive"/></figure></div></div><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="A piña colada against a backdrop of beach, sun, and sky" data-height="4032" data-id="10093" data-link="https://ryanrcampbell.com/img_6252/" data-url="https://ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6252-768x1024.jpg" data-width="3024" src="https://i2.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6252-768x1024.jpg?ssl=1" data-amp-layout="responsive"/></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="A wooden chalice contains mashed plantains and chicken alongside a soup." data-height="4032" data-id="10098" data-link="https://ryanrcampbell.com/img_6233/" data-url="https://ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6233-768x1024.jpg" data-width="3024" src="https://i2.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6233-768x1024.jpg?ssl=1" data-amp-layout="responsive"/></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="A black cat with white paws and underbelly stretches out on a wicker trunk outdoors." data-height="4032" data-id="10103" data-link="https://ryanrcampbell.com/img_6217/" data-url="https://ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6217-768x1024.jpg" data-width="3024" src="https://i2.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6217-768x1024.jpg?ssl=1" data-amp-layout="responsive"/></figure></div></div><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:50.00000%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="Plates of food feature empanadillas and pinchos de churrasco." data-height="4032" data-id="10102" data-link="https://ryanrcampbell.com/img_0072/" data-url="https://ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_0072-768x1024.jpg" data-width="3024" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_0072-768x1024.jpg?ssl=1" data-amp-layout="responsive"/></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:50.00000%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="A tiny hermit crab inside of a small shell crosses wooden steps near a beach." data-height="4032" data-id="10101" data-link="https://ryanrcampbell.com/img_6225/" data-url="https://ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6225-768x1024.jpg" data-width="3024" src="https://i2.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/IMG_6225-768x1024.jpg?ssl=1" data-amp-layout="responsive"/></figure></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>And yes, I know I mentioned coffee on the beach in the post title, but I didn't happen to snap any pictures of me drinking coffee on our balcony overlooking the beach. You'll just have to take my word for it. Also, the cat? His name is Tuxedo, and he's the resident lounger-in-chief at the Tamboo Hotel in Rincón. Truly a celebrity.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2>Okay, Well, Back to Work</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I'm really relieved and grateful to have had the opportunity to speak to the writing community as well as go on vacation again. We're already looking forward to our next trip, which we're hoping will be to Spain later this year.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>But, in the meantime, it's back to work. I've got manuscripts to write and revise, and there's the ol' day job to check in for as well.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2>Share Your Experience</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Until we connect again, <strong>tell me about a recent trip of yours in the comments </strong>(or, if you haven't taken a trip in a moment), tell me where you want to go next!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>And want to have me speak at your event for readers or writers? <a href="http://www.ryanrcampbell.com/contact" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Contact me here.</a></p>
