<p><strong>What do you think? </strong>Tell me in the comments! Personally, I love it, and I'm thankful for the work cover designer Kevin Stone put into it. For more from Kevin, you can <a href="https://good-design-is-good.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">visit his site here.</a> </p>
<p><!-- divi:heading --></p>
