<p>Earlier this year, Lisa Lewis Miller invited me to join her on her Career Clarity podcast. During our conversation, we had the chance to discuss how a trip to Brazil gone awry led me down the path to becoming an author.</p>
<!-- /divi:paragraph -->

<!-- divi:paragraph -->
<p>Lisa conducted a really wonderful interview, and I had a fantastic time discussing my journey with her. </p>
<!-- /divi:paragraph -->

<!-- divi:paragraph -->
<p>You can catch the full interview at <a href='https://getcareerclarity.com/episode95/' rel='noopener noreferrer' target='_blank'>this link.</a></p>
