      "_et_pb_old_content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I recently had the opportunity to be interviewed for author Neda Aria's "Writer vs. Writer" series.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>In it, I explore what went into <em>And Ampersand</em>, what <strong>didn't </strong>go into <em>And Ampersand</em>, and what readers can look forward to when they read this collection of short stories.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
