[et_pb_section fb_built=”1&#8243; _builder_version=”3.22&#8243;][et_pb_row _builder_version=”3.25&#8243; background_size=”initial” background_position=”top_left” background_repeat=”repeat”][et_pb_column type=”4_4&#8243; _builder_version=”3.25&#8243; custom_padding=”|||” custom_padding__hover=”|||”][et_pb_text _builder_version=”3.27.4&#8243; background_size=”initial” background_position=”top_left” background_repeat=”repeat”]<!-- divi:paragraph -->
<p>In case you missed the memo, 2021 is going to be a great year for books.</p>
<!-- /divi:paragraph -->

<!-- divi:paragraph -->
<p>I like to think <em>And Ampersand </em>will be part of what makes 2021 a fantastic year in the world of indie publishing, but if you're not a short story person, there are still plenty of reasons to celebrate.</p>
<!-- /divi:paragraph -->

<!-- divi:paragraph -->
<p>In fact, I've got—<em>checks notes, double checks his count</em>—17 books you can preorder <em>right now</em>, all of which will be available in the coming months.</p>
<!-- /divi:paragraph -->

<!-- divi:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /divi:paragraph -->[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=”4.7.7&#8243; _module_preset=”default”][et_pb_column _builder_version=”4.7.7&#8243; _module_preset=”default” type=”4_4&#8243;][et_pb_button button_text=”REVIEW THE FULL LIST HERE” _builder_version=”4.7.7&#8243; _module_preset=”default” hover_enabled=”0&#8243; sticky_enabled=”0&#8243; button_alignment=”center” button_url=”<a href="https://books.bookfunnel.com/preordernow/dy1911l174&#038;#8243" rel="nofollow">https://books.bookfunnel.com/preordernow/dy1911l174&#038;#8243</a>; url_new_window=”on”][/et_pb_button][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section]
