    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_0 et_section_regular" >
				
				
				
				
					<div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_0">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_0  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>Ordinarily, the individual to whom a book will be dedicated comes to me with ease. <em>And Ampersand </em>was an exception.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>No one person stood out. No one moment emerged as an <em>a-ha!</em>, and yet some entity's gravitational pull slowly drew me into its orbit.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>You. It was you and an experience we share, acknowledged or no.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>Every day, an ending. Every day, a beginning. One begets the other, and we endure both, every day, as we must.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>Endings are not easy. Beginnings are not easy. That they are enjoined is a further encumbrance yet.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>But we need not fear—we're never alone. Not in a beginning. Not in an end. We exist, together, on both sides of the veil separating genesis and resolution, this thousandfold cycle we brave every hour of every day.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>At times, you will feel alone. I will, too. Do.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>But I'm here, as are you. We were here before, and we'll be here after.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>So—</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --> <!-- divi:paragraph --></p>
<p>For you, before and after, always.</p>
<p><!-- /divi:paragraph --></div>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_2 et_animated">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_1  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_0 et_animated et-waypoint">
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1080" height="1080" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=1080%2C1080&#038;ssl=1" alt="" title="And Ampersand with Coffee on Wood Table" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?w=1080&ssl=1 1080w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=1024%2C1024&ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=150%2C150&ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=768%2C768&ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=610%2C610&ssl=1 610w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=980%2C980&ssl=1 980w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=480%2C480&ssl=1 480w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=600%2C600&ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/And-Ampersand-with-Coffee-on-Wood-Table.jpg?resize=100%2C100&ssl=1 100w" sizes="(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px" class="wp-image-9560" data-recalc-dims="1" /></span>
			</div>
