      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "Ordinarily, the individual to whom a book will be dedicated comes to me with ease. And Ampersand was an exception. No one person stood out. No one moment emerged as an a-ha!, and yet some entity's gravitational pull slowly drew me into its orbit. You. It was you and an experience we share, acknowledged or […]
