    "id": 9237,
    "jetpack_featured_media_url": "https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/2021-And-Ampersand-Dedication-Page-Header.png?fit=1200%2C675&ssl=1",
    "jetpack_likes_enabled": false,
    "jetpack_publicize_connections": [],
    "jetpack_sharing_enabled": true,
    "jetpack_shortlink": "https://wp.me/p8ClGp-2oZ",
    "link": "https://ryanrcampbell.com/2021/01/07/for-you-before-and-after-always/",
    "meta": {
      "_et_gb_content_width": "",
      "_et_pb_old_content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Ordinarily, the individual to whom a book will be dedicated comes to me with ease. <em>And Ampersand </em>was an exception.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>No one person stood out. No one moment emerged as an <em>a-ha!</em>, and yet some entity's gravitational pull slowly drew me into its orbit. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You. It was you and an experience we share, acknowledged or no.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Every day, an ending. Every day, a beginning. One begets the other, and we endure both, every day, as we must.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Endings are not easy. Beginnings are not easy. That they are enjoined is a further encumbrance yet. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>But we need not fear—we're never alone. Not in a beginning. Not in an end. We exist, together, on both sides of the veil separating genesis and resolution, this thousandfold cycle we brave every hour of every day.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>At times, you will feel alone. I will, too. Do.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>But I'm here. You as well. We were here before and we'll be here after.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>So—</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>For you, before and after, always.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
