    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>It all starts today with the release of the first three episodes of my new podcast series, Just Me with R.R. Campbell.</p>
<p>It took nearly four years and over one hundred episodes of podcasting for the Writescast Network before I realized I was never <em>once </em>myself in any of them. This left me with one haunting question.</p>
<p><em>Why?</em></p>
<p>Fear, I suspect. Fear of what it might mean to open up, to let go, to let in the light and the dark and the in between. Fear of sharing who I am, what I value, and how I feel about how I arrived at all of this and more.</p>
<p>And the more I thought on this, <strong>the more I came to suspect I’m not alone.</strong></p>
<p>That’s why, starting today, I’m launching Just Me with R.R. Campbell.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="7635" data-permalink="https://ryanrcampbell.com/2020/03/30/live-unscripted-unedited-and-unafraid/just-me-twitter-4/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Just-Me-Twitter-4.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1024,512" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Just Me - Twitter (4)" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Just-Me-Twitter-4.png?fit=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Just-Me-Twitter-4.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" class=" size-full wp-image-7635 aligncenter" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Just-Me-Twitter-4.png?resize=1024%2C512&#038;ssl=1" alt="Just Me - Twitter (4)" width="1024" height="512" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Just-Me-Twitter-4.png?w=1024&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Just-Me-Twitter-4.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Just-Me-Twitter-4.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Just-Me-Twitter-4.png?resize=624%2C312&amp;ssl=1 624w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p>Over the course of twenty-minute episodes now available as either podcasts or in video, we explore topics like grief, joy, friendship, and fear, and we do it all with one goal in mind: living unscripted, living unedited, and living unafraid.</p>
<p>Along the way, we’ll learn more about ourselves, too: who we’ve been, who we are, and who we might become.</p>
<p>So join me right now. <strong>The first three episodes of “Just Me” are now streaming on <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/id1503674576" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Podcasts</a>, <a href="https://www.podchaser.com/podcasts/just-me-with-rr-campbell-1045962" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Podchaser</a>, <a href="https://tunein.com/podcasts/Arts--Culture-Podcasts/Just-Me-with-RR-Campbell-p1307446/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TuneIn</a>, <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/5PFUecepf4qrbOkBRg7a3r" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spotify</a>, and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCR7HG_mnTLwGCLnDLbEOpUg?sub_confirmation=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube</a></strong>. Two more episodes will follow later this week, and then, starting on Thursday, April 9th, we’ll move to weekly explorations of all the topics mentioned above and beyond.</p>
<p>Thanks for joining me, everyone. You can find the first three episodes in video format below.</p>
<p><span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="1080" height="608" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/co3-TLa8sQA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span></p>
<p><span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="1080" height="608" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/FzGjKdtKIzM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span></p>
<p><span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="1080" height="608" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/eKrx-_YTXkc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span></p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://link.chtbl.com/justmewithrr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Subscribe to “Just Me with R.R. Campbell” on your favorite podcasting platform.</a></h3>
