    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Folks, the time has come for a year-end sale.</p>
<p>From now through December 31st, signed copies of all of my novels are 15%+ off, and I've lowered the free shipping threshold for shipments within the U.S. as well! If you've been after signed copies of any of my novels&#8212;or if the readers in your life might want one for a holiday gift&#8212;now's the best time to make a purchase!</p>
<p>Don't miss out. These deals are only available here on rrcampbellwrites.com while supplies last.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/shop">Click here to head to the R.R. Campbell Writes Shop and start saving.</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
