//i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Fireplace-Mockup.jpg?resize=768%2C480&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Fireplace-Mockup.jpg?resize=1024%2C640&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Fireplace-Mockup.jpg?resize=624%2C390&amp;ssl=1 624w" width="369" height="231" loading="lazy" data-original-width="369" data-original-height="231" itemprop="http://schema.org/image" title="Fireplace Mockup" alt="Fireplace Mockup" style="width: 369px; height: 231px;" /> </a> </div> </div> <!-- close group --> <div class="gallery-group images-1" style="width: 357px; height: 235px;" data-original-width="357" data-original-height="235" > <div class="tiled-gallery-item tiled-gallery-item-large" itemprop="associatedMedia" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ImageObject"> <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/2019/08/02/the-secrets-out-your-books-beautifully-shopped/ipad-with-glasses/" border="0" itemprop="url"> <meta itemprop="width" content="353"> <meta itemprop="height" content="231"> <img decoding="async" class="" data-attachment-id="6590" data-orig-file="https://ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png" data-orig-size="1600,1045" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="iPad with Glasses" data-image-description="" data-medium-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png?fit=300%2C196&#038;ssl=1" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png?fit=1024%2C669&#038;ssl=1" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png?w=353&#038;h=231&#038;ssl=1" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png?w=1600&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png?resize=300%2C196&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png?resize=768%2C502&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png?resize=1024%2C669&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/iPad-with-Glasses.png?resize=624%2C408&amp;ssl=1 624w" width="353" height="231" loading="lazy" data-original-width="353" data-original-height="231" itemprop="http://schema.org/image" title="iPad with Glasses" alt="iPad with Glasses" style="width: 353px; height: 231px;" /> </a> </div> </div> <!-- close group --> </div> <!-- close row --> </div></p>
<h2>What's Mockup Shots?</h2>
<p>Mockup Shots is online software by Adazing that lets you upload your covers to create high-quality images of your book(s) for marketing and publicity purposes.</p>
<p>Using Mockup Shots has helped me further develop my brand and sharpened my web presence, whether it be on Twitter, Facebook, Instagram, or this site. Not only that, but it's saved me <em>tons </em>of time; whenever I need a stunning new photo of one of my books, I can simply hop into Mockup Shots and generate one in minutes.</p>
<p>Sound awesome? It is.</p>
<p><strong>Want to see your books in a mockup shot? Now you can. </strong></p>
<p><a href="http://adazing.ontraport.com/t?orid=195960&amp;opid=16" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">At this link</a>, you can upload your cover image and get <strong>three free mockup shots</strong> in return. More interested in a gif similar to the below? <a href="https://www.adazing.com/ngif?orid=195960&amp;opid=25" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Click here.</a> Interested in both still images and a gif? Take advantage of both links!</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="6591" data-permalink="https://ryanrcampbell.com/2019/08/02/the-secrets-out-your-books-beautifully-shopped/afia-christmas-gif/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/AFIA-Christmas-Gif.gif?fit=600%2C400&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="600,400" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="AFIA Christmas Gif" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/AFIA-Christmas-Gif.gif?fit=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/AFIA-Christmas-Gif.gif?fit=600%2C400&amp;ssl=1" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-6591" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/AFIA-Christmas-Gif.gif?resize=600%2C400&#038;ssl=1" alt="AFIA Christmas Gif.gif" width="600" height="400" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p>Whether or not you take advantage of the three free images or the free gif, Mockup Shots is currently running a deal where you can get lifetime access to the full library of mockups (including the new ones they add each month) at a reduced price. So don't miss out; <a href="http://adazing.ontraport.com/t?orid=195960&amp;opid=26">get in on this deal while it lasts!</a></p>
<p>Which of the hundreds of available mockup shots are you most interested in based on what you've seen above? How do you see this changing your web presence for the better? Let me know in the comments.</p>
<hr />
<p>Like what you've read here? You can <a href="http://eepurl.com/dhBxcv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">subscribe to my newsletter</a> to get more articles like these throughout the year. And don't forget to follow me on <a href="http://www.twitter.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Twitter</a>, <a href="http://www.instagram.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>, and <a href="http://www.facebook.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a>, too. You can also meet me at any one of <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/events">my upcoming events</a>, or <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/contact">reach out about having me speak at one of your own</a>.</p>
