    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Four people. One study. The internet-access brain implant to bind or destroy them all.</p>
<p>Oh, and an awesome June deal on EMPATHY series e-books!</p>
<p>Thanks to NineStar Press, you can now get 40% off every e-book in the EMPATHY series by using code PRIDE at check-out on ninestarpress.com.</p>
<p>Not familiar with the first book in the series, <em>Imminent Dawn</em>? Check out the trailer below to get a feel for why it debuted at number one for its genre on Amazon!</p>
<p><span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="1080" height="608" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/O8KN4kcDFIo?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span></p>
<p>Awesome, right? <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/">Now click here and use keyword PRIDE at check-out to get that 40% off while it lasts!</a></p>
<p>Have you read <em>Imminent Dawn</em> but haven't yet jumped into book two, <em>Mourning Dove</em>? Or maybe you're considering getting books one and two while they're both on sale (which you should very much do). You can check out the trailer for <em>Mourning Dove</em> below!</p>
<p><span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="1080" height="608" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GN0Piht_Qg4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span></p>
<p>I know, right? And the action only picks up from there with the later books in the series, which are due out in 2020 and beyond.</p>
<p><a href="http://ninestarpress.com/product/mourning-dove">So get book <em>Mourning Dove </em>here, too, while you're at it!</a> There's never been a better time to start working toward those summer reading goals.</p>
<p>Remember, <strong>this deal won't last long. Act now and don't miss out!</strong></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
