    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "Last weekend's stop for the EMPATHY spring tour was another fantastic one. I had a wonderful time visiting the Reader's Loft bookstore in Green Bay and am thankful for their support. Thanks, too, to everyone who came out to say hello. The EMPATHY spring tour will conclude on Thursday, June 20th at Books and Beer in Columbus, […]",
