    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>This weekend kicked off the 2019 spring tour for the EMPATHY series! I had a wonderful time hanging out at Turtle Creek Books in Beloit, Wisconsin, where I signed copies of <em>Imminent Dawn </em>and <em>Mourning Dove</em> while answering questions for folks who swung by during the city's first farmers' market of the year.</p>
<p>The Turtle Creek event was also the first to be held after the release of <em>Mourning Dove</em>, and the excitement for book two in this series was really extraordinary.</p>
<p>So thank you, Beloit. I look forward to continuing the EMPATHY tour in <a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/345448059645534/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Eau Claire on May 11th at Dotters Books.</a></p>
<p>Until then, here are some photos from my visit to Beloit!</p>
