    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Matt Doyle Media recently interviewed me about the EMPATHY science fiction saga in the lead up to the release of <em>Mourning Dove</em>, which debuted this week!</p>
<p><a href="https://mattdoylemedia.com/2019/05/02/author-interview-r-r-campbell-iii-2/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">In this interview</a>, I open up about how things progress for our favorite (and not so favorite) characters from book one, <em>Imminent Dawn</em>, into book two. I also comment on how the writing is coming for book three in the series, <em>Event Horizon</em>!</p>
<p>So give it a read at the link above, and don't forget to snag your copies of the first two books in the series below.</p>
<h2 style="text-align: center;"><em>Imminent Dawn</em></h2>
