    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p><em>Mourning Dove </em>debuted in the top ten for new releases in LGBT science fiction on Amazon! Thanks to everyone who's shown their support so far for book two of the EMPATHY sci-fi saga.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-797" src="https://empathynovel.files.wordpress.com/2019/04/screen-shot-2019-04-25-at-12.07.50-pm-e1556212137385.png?resize=335%2C373" alt="Screen Shot 2019-04-25 at 12.07.50 PM" width="335" height="373" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p>Can we make it to number one? We can, and you can help us get there by grabbing a paperback copy of <em>Mourning Dove </em>at the Amazon link below.</p>
<h2 style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>Mourning Dove</em></strong></h2>
<h2 style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QZGSDX6"><strong>Amazon</strong></a><strong> | </strong><a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/books/1131295072"><strong>Barnes &amp; Noble</strong></a><strong> | </strong><a href="http://ninestarpress.com/product/mourning-dove"><strong>NineStar Press</strong></a><strong> | </strong><a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/mourning-dove-7"><strong>Kobo</strong></a><strong> | </strong><a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/935036"><strong>Smashwords</strong></a><strong> | </strong><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43728390-mourning-dove"><strong>Goodreads</strong></a><strong> | </strong><a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/product/signedmourningdove/"><strong>Author Website</strong></a></h2>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
