    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>You can now order your <em>Mourning Dove </em>ebooks on Amazon.</p>
<p>Help <em>Mourning Dove </em>reach number one in LGBT science fiction&#8212;just like book one in the series, <em>Imminent Dawn</em>&#8212;by ordering your ebook copy today!</p>
<h2 style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QZGSDX6/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Order your <em>Mourning Dove </em>ebook on Amazon here.</a></h2>
<p>Still need to get your hands on a copy of EMPATHY book one, <em>Imminent Dawn</em>? You can find it at the below links.</p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Imminent Dawn</strong></em></h3>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a> | <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/product/signedimminentdawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Author Website</a></p>
