    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>I'd like to thank everyone who attended last night's book reading and signing event at A Room of One's Own. Thank you for coming out and for your engagement!</p>
<p>For those of you who couldn't attend (and even for those of you who could), we've got pictures taken at the event below.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-756" src="https://empathynovel.files.wordpress.com/2019/04/img_2670-e1555694849424.jpg?resize=1080%2C810" alt="IMG_2670" width="1080" height="810" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-757" src="https://empathynovel.files.wordpress.com/2019/04/img_2674-e1555694517710.jpg?resize=1080%2C1080" alt="IMG_2674" width="1080" height="1080" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-758" src="https://empathynovel.files.wordpress.com/2019/04/img_2684-e1555694552558.jpg?resize=1080%2C1448" alt="img_2684.jpg" width="1080" height="1448" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-759" src="https://empathynovel.files.wordpress.com/2019/04/img_2688-e1555694594460.jpg?resize=1080%2C1080" alt="IMG_2688" width="1080" height="1080" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p>Both M.A. Hinkle and I were very pleased with the evening, and we hope you were, too!</p>
<p>Want to catch me at a future event? <a href="http://empathyseries.com/events/">You can find a full list of upcoming events here.</a></p>
<p>Still need to get your hands on <em>Imminent Dawn</em>, the book that debuted at number one in new releases for LGBT science fiction on Amazon? You can get it and preorder its sequel, <em>Mourning Dove</em>, at the below links!</p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Imminent Dawn</strong></em></h3>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a> | <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/product/signedimminentdawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Author Website</a></p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Mourning Dove<br />
</strong></em>(preorders)</h3>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://ninestarpress.com/product/mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press (ebook)</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43728390-mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Goodreads</a> | <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/?post_type=product&amp;p=5816&amp;preview=true" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Author Website (print)</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
