    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>As a way to say thank you to the RevPit community, I'm proud to offer the following editing discounts to any RevPit participant who books these services<strong> on or before April 24th, 2019.</strong></p>
<h2><a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/querycritiques/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Query and First Five Pages</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>
<h3>Take <strong>$10 off </strong>this package</h3>
</li>
<li>
<h3>Includes two passes at query, one pass at first five pages</h3>
</li>
</ul>
<h2><a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/fiftyforsixty/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">First Fifty Pages</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>
<h3>Take <strong>$10 off </strong>this package</h3>
</li>
<li>
<h3>Includes one detailed pass at your novel's first fifty pages</h3>
</li>
</ul>
<h2><a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/developmentaledit/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developmental Edits</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>
<h3>Take <span style="color: #ff0000;"><strong>up to 30% off</strong></span> when combined with <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/editingdiscounts/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">other discounts</a></h3>
</li>
<li>
<h3>Includes full developmental edit of entire manuscript</h3>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 style="text-align: center;">To lock in these discounts, you must <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/lets-do-this/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact me</a> and book your package on or before April 24th, 2019.</h3>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
