    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>It's true! <em>Mourning Dove </em>ebook preorders are 30% off if you use code PREORDER at checkout at ninestarpress.com.</p>
<p>Not only can you lock in these awesome savings now, but you can start reading three days before the book is released if you get it through the NineStar site!</p>
<p>So act now. Check out the ebook preorder link below, and don't forget to nab your copy of the prequel, <em>Imminent Dawn</em>, while you're at it too!</p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Mourning Dove<br />
</strong></em>(preorders)</h3>
