      "rendered": "Cinephile and fellow author Dave Watson recently interviewed me for a post on his blog, “Dave Says Movies Matter.” In it, I describe how the EMPATHY series started as a short story over half a decade ago, and what the future might hold for it and our expansive cast of characters. So what are you […]",
    },
