    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "Though I've previously noted my upcoming appearance at WisCon 43 as a vendor, I'm now thrilled to announce I've been invited to lead two sessions on the craft of writing during the course of the conference. The two sessions I'll be leading are&#8212; Solidify Your Scenes with the Five Core Components of Scene Structure Why […]",
