    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "Have you heard? I'm coming to a city near you&#8212;assuming you're in Wisconsin, that is. To celebrate the release of the first two books in the EMPATHY series, I'll be visiting your favorite indie bookstores (and at least one brewery!) across Wisconsin this spring for readings and signings in every corner of my home state. […]",
