    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p><em>Imminent Dawn </em>and I got a nice feature over on the blog of author Nicki J Markus! This series of posts on her site asks authors to name three of their favorites, bits of advice, or things they're looking forward to in the coming year.</p>
<p>Want to know how I answered those questions for the EMPATHY universe and <em>Imminent Dawn </em>in particular? <a href="http://www.nickijmarkus.com/2019/03/author-interview3-r-r-campbell.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">You can check out the full post here.</a></p>
<p>And when you're done, don't forget to pick up your copy of <em>Imminent Dawn </em>on the sites below! Oh, and be sure to <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43728390-mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>add book two in the series, <em>Mourning Dove</em>, on Goodreads!</strong></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
