    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>It's true! You can now place your preorder for <strong>ebook</strong> <strong>copies of <em>Mourning Dove </em>at ninestarpress.com.</strong> Not only that, but placing your preorder there will mean you can <strong>start reading three days early on April 26, 2019.</strong></p>
<p>Or if you're looking for a <strong>signed, print copy</strong> of the book, you can preorder one through this website.</p>
<p>Get your hands on the much-anticipated sequel to <em>Imminent Dawn </em>by securing your copy at either of the links below. And don't forget to add the book on Goodreads!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43728390-mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Goodreads</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/product/preordermourningdove/">R.R. Campbell Writes Shop</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
    "date": "2019-03-13T10:00:26",
    "date_gmt": "2019-03-13T16:00:26",
