    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "It's true! You can now place your preorder for ebook copies of Mourning Dove at ninestarpress.com. Not only that, but placing your preorder there will mean you can start reading three days early on April 26, 2019. Or if you're looking for a signed, print copy of the book, you can preorder one through this website. Get your hands […]",
