    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p><span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="1080" height="608" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GN0Piht_Qg4ichor?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span></p>
<h2 style="text-align: center;">Honor the past.<br />
Embrace the present.<br />
Seize the future.</h2>
<p>With music composed by the author himself, the <em>Mourning Dove </em>book trailer is now available! Get pumped for the release of the sequel to the much acclaimed <em>Imminent Dawn</em> with a view of this teaser video&#8212;and don't forget to share it on social media!</p>
<p>If you still haven't read book one, you can find it at the below links.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">And you can add <em>Mourning Dove </em>on Goodreads and preorder your ebook copy today below! Be sure to use code PREORDER at checkout for 30% off.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43728390-mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Goodreads</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
