    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>The countdown is over! The official <em>Mourning Dove </em>cover has been unveiled at <a href="http://www.lgbtqreads.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LGBTQreads.com</a>.</p>
<p>Head there now to get the first look at the cover of the sequel to <em>Imminent Dawn</em>!</p>
<p>This April, it's time to honor the past, embrace the present, and seize the future with <em>EMPATHY: Mourning Dove.</em> Until then, make sure you've read your copy of <em>Imminent Dawn </em>prior to <em>Mourning Dove</em>‘s release! You can find it online at any of the links below.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
    "date": "2019-03-11T10:00:26",
    "date_gmt": "2019-03-11T16:00:26",
    "download_link": "",
    "episode_data": {
      "embedCode": "<blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="YGYCngqPr0"><a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/2019/03/11/unveiled-the-cover-for-mourning-dove/">Unveiled: the Cover for Mourning Dove</a></blockquote><iframe sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" src="https://ryanrcampbell.com/2019/03/11/unveiled-the-cover-for-mourning-dove/embed/#?secret=YGYCngqPr0" width="500" height="350" title="“Unveiled: the Cover for Mourning Dove” &#8212; Ryan R. Campbell" data-secret="YGYCngqPr0" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no" class="wp-embedded-content"></iframe><script type="text/javascript">
