    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "The countdown is over! The official Mourning Dove cover has been unveiled at LGBTQreads.com. Head there now to get the first look at the cover of the sequel to Imminent Dawn! This April, it's time to honor the past, embrace the present, and seize the future with EMPATHY: Mourning Dove. Until then, make sure you've read your copy of Imminent […]",
