    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Join author r. r. campbell for a reading and book signing event at Pearl Street Books in La Crosse, Wisconsin on June 1st, 2019.</p>
<p>The author will read from <em>Imminent Dawn</em>, <em>Mourning Dove</em>, and his other releases, as well as take questions from attendees about all things EMPATHY and writing-related. Who knows? Perhaps you'll even get a sneak peek at future installments in the EMPATHY sci-fi saga!</p>
<p>Want to attend? <a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/433880777354117/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">You can RSVP and learn more here.</a> Not in the La Crosse, Wisconsin area? <a href="http://www.empathyseries.com/events" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check out the full events listing on this page</a> to see if r. r. will be in your neck of the woods soon.</p>
<p>If you still haven't got your copy of <em>Imminent Dawn</em>, you can request it at your local bookstore or find it at the links below.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
    "date": "2019-03-08T11:00:35",
