    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>That's right! From now through March 9th, <em>Imminent Dawn </em>ebooks are 50% off on Smashwords.</p>
<p>That means you can start reading the story <em>New York Times </em>bestselling author Matt Forbeck as called <strong>“an incisive techno-thriller that gets more tense with every page”</strong> today for only $3.50 when you order through Smashwords.</p>
<p>This deal is <strong>only available through March 9th</strong>, so grab your copy today!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Click here to start reading <em>Imminent Dawn </em>before its sequel debuts in April.</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
