    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>If you thought the turnaround time between the release of <em>Imminent Dawn </em>and <em>Mourning Dove </em>might've had things moving at breakneck speed, you're not alone.</p>
<p>And, in the interest of keeping necks everywhere intact, we'll be pushing back the release date of <em>Mourning Dove </em>by three weeks to <strong>April 29, 2019.</strong></p>
<p>Disappointed you'll have to wait three more weeks? Don't be. We'll have some <strong>exciting new announcements </strong>coming throughout this week to help tide you over until the book is out!</p>
<p>If you're late to the game and haven't yet got your hands on the book readers have compared to <em>Game of Thrones </em>and <em>Black Mirror</em>, you can get your copy at any of the links below!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
    "date": "2019-03-04T11:00:28",
