    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Tonight's the night! From 6 - 8 p.m. at the Goodman Community Center on Madison's east side, join me for:</p>
<ul>
<li>refreshments provided by the author</li>
<li>readings from <em>Imminent Dawn</em></li>
<li>the debut of <em>EMPATHY: Madrugada</em>, a choose-your-own-destiny game</li>
<li>an author Q&amp;A</li>
<li>book signing!</li>
<li>an EXCLUSIVE REVEAL available only to those who attend the book launch</li>
</ul>
<p>Able to make it? Want to learn more? RSVP on Facebook!</p>
<p>If you haven't yet got a copy of the book, you can find it on the sites below. And don't forget to <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43728390-mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>add book two, <em>Mourning Dove</em>, on Goodreads.</strong></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
