    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>The book launch party for <em>Imminent Dawn </em>is this Friday, and Madison Magazine is making sure we don't forget! It was included in <a href="https://www.channel3000.com/madison-magazine/arts-and-culture/50-things-to-do-in-february/990870549" target="_blank" rel="noopener">this list of Madison-area events and must-dos</a> for the month of February. Check it out!</p>
<p>There are a number of wonderful events taking place throughout the Madison metro area this month, and I'm honored to be included among them. If you'd like to attend the book launch, you can <a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/2114615952182145/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">find more information (and RSVP) here!</a></p>
<p>And if you haven't yet nabbed your copy of the book, you can do so at any of the links below.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
