    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Wahoo! We've got another boost for the EMPATHY series featured on the official home of the University of Wisconsin Continuing Studies in Writing. <a href="https://continuingstudies.wisc.edu/writers-success-stories/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">In this short blurb</a>, they detail the status of the first two books in the series.</p>
<p>As it mentions in their post, I'll also be speaking at this year's UW Writers' Institute, leading four sessions and participating in Friday's success panel. I'll also have books available during Saturday's bookstore.</p>
<p>To learn more about the Institute&#8212;which does require registration in order to attend&#8212;<a href="https://uwwritersinstitute.wisc.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">you can visit the conference's website here</a>.</p>
<p>If you haven't got your copy of <em>Imminent Dawn </em>yet, be sure to check out the following links. Oh, and you can now <strong><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43728390-mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener">add book two, <em>Mourning Dove</em></a><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43728390-mourning-dove" target="_blank" rel="noopener">, on Goodreads</a>.</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
