      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" size-full wp-image-504 alignright" src="https://thursdaysatpornucopia.files.wordpress.com/2019/02/afia-valentines-day.png?resize=1024%2C512" alt="AFIA - Valentine's Day.png" width="1024" height="512" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<h2 style="text-align: center;">An IRS audit.</h2>
<h2 style="text-align: center;">A money laundering scheme.</h2>
<h2 style="text-align: center;">The porn-star-turned-accountant<br />
stuck accounting for it all.</h2>
<p style="text-align: center;">On behalf of Robin and the entire cast of <em>Accounting for It All</em>, I'd like to wish you a happy Valentine's Day!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Looking for a last minute romance read? <em>Accounting for It All </em>has you covered. You can find it on the below sites and with most other major retailers.</p>
<h2 style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Accounting-All-R-R-Campbell-ebook/dp/B07KDQBZ55/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1543358936&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/accounting-for-it-all/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/books/1129827229;jsessionid=62066B592FE7E62FA5EBFA0BBD49688F.prodny_store01-atgap15?ean=9781949909388&amp;st=AFF&amp;2sid=Goodreads,%20Inc_2227948_NA&amp;sourceId=AFFGoodreads,%20Inc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/42604499-accounting-for-it-all" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Goodreads</a></h2>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
