    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Ooh, look! <em>Imminent Dawn </em>has been featured on Floralcars in an article titled <strong><a href="https://www.floralcars.com/2019/02/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">“Five Reasons Why You Have to Read <em>Imminent Dawn </em></a></strong><strong><a href="https://www.floralcars.com/2019/02/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">by R. R. Campbell.”</a></strong></p>
<p>Floralcars is, per its website, “a beauty, book, lifestyle, and travel blog” based out of Europe, with writers in Austria and Germany.</p>
<p>So what are the five reasons why you need to check out <em>Imminent Dawn</em>? You'll have to <a href="https://www.floralcars.com/2019/02/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read this article on Floralcars to find out!</a></p>
<p>And if you haven't got yourself a copy of the book yet, you can find it on the sites below!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
