    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Oh, hey! <em>Imminent Dawn </em>has received a shout-out in <em>Madison Magazine </em>online. In <a href="https://www.channel3000.com/madison-magazine/arts-and-culture/27-local-books-to-add-to-your-2019-reading-list/980853304" target="_blank" rel="noopener">“28 local books to add to your 2019 reading list,”</a> <em>Imminent Dawn </em>gets a mention in that 28th and final spot, but you'll hear no complaints from me; it's an honor to be included on any list with these prolific Wisconsin or Wisconsin-tied writers.</p>
<p>Be sure to pay a visit to that article above and, hey, consider dropping a comment showing your support for <em>Imminent Dawn</em>‘s inclusion. And if you haven't got a copy of the book itself yet, you can find it on the below sites!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss?url=search-alias%3Daps&amp;field-keywords=imminent+dawn+r.+r.+campbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
