    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Greetings from the EMPATHY-verse! I'm pleased to relay the <em>Imminent Dawn </em>launch party is now up <a href="https://madison.com/calendar/books-readings/book-launch-party-for-imminent-dawn-by-r-r-campbell/event_85f1fb36-2983-11e9-bc7e-308d99b2b460.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">on the madison.com community events calendar</a>, which will make it even easier to share with others and invite your friends to attend along with you.</p>
<p>So check it out at the link above, and make sure you <a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/2114615952182145/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RSVP at this link</a> to let me know you'll be there. And if you haven't got yourself a copy of <em>Imminent Dawn </em>yet, you can do so at the links below.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
