    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p><a href="https://empathyseries.com/2019/01/24/icymi-appearance-on-wsum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fresh off an appearance on 91.7 WSUM</a>, I took to the airwaves again when <a href="http://www.wrotepodcast.com/r-r-campbell/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">I joined WROTE Podcast co-hosts Vance Bastian and SA Collins to talk all things <em>Imminent Dawn</em></a>.</p>
<p>Over the course of this interview, we explore the book, the technology behind it, and what, exactly, is meant by the episode title, “Quote-Unquote-Fun.”</p>
<p><a href="http://www.wrotepodcast.com/r-r-campbell/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tune in now</a> for a laugh or two, and you might even learn something new along the way. And if you haven't yet picked up your copy of <em>Imminent Dawn</em>, you can do so at the links below!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Imminent-Dawn-EMPATHY-Book-1-ebook/dp/B07N1Q8C6G/ref=tmm_kin_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;qid=1548982375&amp;sr=8-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
