    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>It's hard to believe <em>Imminent Dawn </em>has only been out for four days! Even so, it's got itself another feature here on the interwebs, this time with Matt Doyle Media.</p>
<p>Matt does a fantastic job developing questions for his guests, so if you really want to learn about EMPATHY and the writing process behind <em>Imminent Dawn</em>, you'll definitely want to <a href="https://mattdoylemedia.com/2019/01/31/authorinterviewrrcampbell2/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>check out this feature</strong></a> about it.</p>
<p>And when you're done (or possibly even before you read the article), you can get your copy of <em>Imminent Dawn </em>from one of the below links and add it on Goodreads! Happy reading.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss?url=search-alias%3Daps&amp;field-keywords=imminent+dawn+r.+r.+campbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
