    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "It's hard to believe Imminent Dawn has only been out for four days! Even so, it's got itself another feature here on the interwebs, this time with Matt Doyle Media. Matt does a fantastic job developing questions for his guests, so if you really want to learn about EMPATHY and the writing process behind Imminent Dawn, you'll definitely […]",
