    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Kevin Klehr, author of <em>Social Media Central</em> among other titles, was kind enough to host me on his “Musings of an Overthinker” blog to talk about EMPATHY and the brain-computer interface in general.</p>
<p>Want to learn more about the brain-computer interface in real life and how it <em>comes </em>to life in <em>Imminent Dawn</em>? <a href="https://kevinklehr.com/2019/01/28/empathy-and-the-brain-computer-interface-guest-blog-from-r-r-campbell/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check out the post at this link!</a></p>
<p>Oh, and be sure to visit tomorrow for a guest post from Kevin Klehr on empathyseries.com.</p>
<p>And don't miss out on <em>Imminent Dawn </em>on all your favorite bookish sites! You can check them out at the links below.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss?url=search-alias%3Daps&amp;field-keywords=imminent+dawn+r.+r.+campbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
