    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>Four people. One study. The internet-access brain implant to bind or destroy them all.</p>
<p>Oh, and one awesome book birthday!</p>
<p>Today's the day: <em>Imminent Dawn </em>is now available worldwide. And, as the first installment in the epic EMPATHY sci-fi saga, you'll want to get reading it <em>now </em>so you're prepared when book two, <em>Mourning Dove</em>, drops later this year.</p>
<p>What have early reviewers said about <em>Imminent Dawn</em>?</p>
<blockquote><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">“An incisive techno-thriller that gets more tense with every page. Campbell’s extrapolated vision of our hyper-connected future is all too real.”<br />
</span></p></blockquote>
<h4 style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">— Matt Forbeck, </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">New York Times</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> bestselling author</span></h4>
<blockquote><p>“… freaking sci-fi <em>Game of Thrones</em>.” <span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span></p></blockquote>
<h4 style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">— M.A. Hinkle, author of <em>Death of a Bachelor </em>and <em>Diamond Heart</em></span></h4>
<blockquote><p>“… intriguing, troubling, and all too real-feeling.” <span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span></p></blockquote>
<h4 style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">— Dan Schiro, author of <em>Rogue Destiny </em>and <em>This Bloody Game</em></span></h4>
<blockquote><p>“My mind is blown… a superb science fiction thriller.” <span style="font-weight: 400;"><br />
</span></p></blockquote>
<h4 style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">—</span> Joc, a Goodreads reviewer</h4>
<p>In other words, the hype is real. Get on board the EMPATHY hype train now by purchasing <em>Imminent Dawn </em>from your preferred retailer below, or by requesting it at your library or local bookstore.</p>
<p>A new day has broken. Let's face it together.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss?url=search-alias%3Daps&amp;field-keywords=imminent+dawn+r.+r.+campbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
