    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" size-full wp-image-377 aligncenter" src="https://empathynovel.files.wordpress.com/2019/01/screen-shot-2019-01-25-at-5.25.56-pm.png?resize=849%2C397" alt="screen shot 2019-01-25 at 5.25.56 pm" width="849" height="397" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p>Big news from the EMPATHYverse&#8212;we've debuted at number one for LGBT Science Fiction on Amazon!</p>
<p>Thank you to everyone for their support of this book and series. I couldn't be more thrilled to know <em>Imminent Dawn </em>has landed in the number one spot three days before it's officially released. Let's see if we can keep up the momentum!</p>
<p>Want to get your hands on a copy of <em>Imminent Dawn</em>? You can find it at the links below.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss?url=search-alias%3Daps&amp;field-keywords=imminent+dawn+r.+r.+campbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amazon</a> | <a href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/imminent-dawn-rr-campbell/1130343569?ean=2940161198599" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barnes &amp; Noble</a> | <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/product/imminent-dawn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NineStar Press</a> | <a href="https://www.kobo.com/us/en/ebook/imminent-dawn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kobo</a> | <a href="https://www.smashwords.com/books/view/919525" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Smashwords</a> | <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/43196570-imminent-dawn">Goodreads</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
    "date": "2019-01-26T07:00:46",
