    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "We're now only 46 days from the release of Imminent Dawn, and beginning next week at empathynovel.com, you'll get to meet its four main characters face to face&#8212;so to speak. Starting on Monday, December 17th, you'll be introduced to the epic EMPATHY sci-fi saga's art-school dropout protagonist, along with the ruthless tech magnate, the advancement-hungry administrative assistant, […]",
