    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="5340" data-permalink="https://ryanrcampbell.com/2018/10/15/first-chapter-reveal-this-thursday/afia-featured-for-first-chapter-reveal/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/AFIA-Featured-for-First-Chapter-Reveal.png?fit=1920%2C1439&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1920,1439" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="AFIA Featured for First Chapter Reveal" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/AFIA-Featured-for-First-Chapter-Reveal.png?fit=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/AFIA-Featured-for-First-Chapter-Reveal.png?fit=1024%2C767&amp;ssl=1" class=" size-full wp-image-5340 aligncenter" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/AFIA-Featured-for-First-Chapter-Reveal.png?resize=1080%2C809&#038;ssl=1" alt="AFIA Featured for First Chapter Reveal" width="1080" height="809" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/AFIA-Featured-for-First-Chapter-Reveal.png?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/AFIA-Featured-for-First-Chapter-Reveal.png?resize=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/AFIA-Featured-for-First-Chapter-Reveal.png?resize=1024%2C767&amp;ssl=1 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p>To celebrate the imminent release of my debut novel, <em><a href="https://accountingforitall.com/book/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Accounting for it All</a></em>, I’ll be posting the book’s first chapter on <a href="http://www.accountingforitall.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AccountingForItAll.com</a> on Thursday, October 18th!</p>
<p>For now, though, I’ll share <em>the book’s first line</em>.</p>
<blockquote>
<h4>Thursdays are my favorite days at Pornucopia.</h4>
</blockquote>
<p>So what’s Pornucopia? Why is it our protagonist’s favorite day? What comes next?</p>
<p>The answers to all of this and more will be revealed in this Thursday’s post! Be sure to visit accountingforitall.com then.</p>
<p>Until October 18th, you can learn more about the novel on this blog, <a href="http://www.twitter.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter</a>, <a href="http://www.facebook.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a>, or <a href="http://eepurl.com/dhBxcv" target="_blank" rel="noopener">my newsletter</a>.</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
