    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>I am pleased to announce that I will have another novel published with NineStar Press: my sci-fi thriller, <em>EMPATHY: Imminent Dawn. </em>It is the first installment of a planned series.</p>
<p>~~~</p>
<p>On the outskirts of Austin, Texas near the capital of the conniving North American Union, rumors leak from the secretive research compound of the most powerful tech company in the world: news&#8212;both promising and devastating&#8212;of an internet-access brain implant transformative enough to change millions of lives&#8212;beginning with four lives, most specifically.</p>
<p>The investigative journalist who seeks the tech story of a lifetime, but must choose between her morals and her survival when her sleuthing runs afoul of the government’s designs.</p>
<p>The desperate art-school dropout, whose enrollment in the high-risk trial for the implant is a last ditch effort to apologize for her role in her wife’s coma.</p>
<p>The reclusive businessman, who would let his tech empire crumble if it meant he could bring his wife back from the dead.</p>
<p>And the advancement-hungry administrative assistant who ignores every warning… until it's too late to save herself, and possibly hundreds of patients on the research compound.</p>
<p dir="ltr">Over the course of <em>EMPATHY: Imminent Dawn</em>, the lives of these four strangers are set on a collision course that will leave them all floundering to reclaim that which they desire most: their loved ones, their freedom, their lives.</p>
<p>~~~</p>
<p>You can look forward to having a copy of <em>EMPATHY: Imminent Dawn</em> in your hands (and on your e-reader!) in <strong>January 2019.</strong></p>
<p>To stay up to date as more details come in, I encourage you to <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/newsletter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribe to my monthly newsletter</a>, <a href="http://www.twitter.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow me on Twitter</a> and <a href="http://www.facebook.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">my author page on Facebook</a>, check out my <a href="https://www.instagram.com/iamrrcampbell/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>, and <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/blog/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">keep an eye on my blog</a> as the months advance.</p>
<p>For more information on NineStar Press and the cornucopia of talented authors they’ve published to date, you can visit <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their website</a>, <a href="https://twitter.com/ninestarpress" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter feed</a>, <a href="https://www.facebook.com/ninestarpress" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook page</a>, and <a href="https://www.tumblr.com/blog/ninestarpress" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tumblr</a>.</p>
<p>A huge thank you to all of you for your support, and to NineStar Press for believing in this book and its planned sequels.</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
