    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>I am absolutely thrilled to announce that my novel, <em>Accounting For It All</em>, has been selected for publication by the incredible team at NineStar Press. Below, you'll find an abbreviated version of the book's premise, which I used when pitching the project.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">~~~</p>
<p>When porn-star-turned-accountant Robin Whethers becomes the target of an IRS investigation, she figures things can’t get any worse. She’s unwittingly been at the center of a vast money laundering scheme, and to top it off, she has no real accounting knowledge.</p>
<p>Somehow, though, the investigation is the least of her concerns: hanging over her is the impending death of her terminally ill mother from whom Robin is estranged. Then there's the woman Robin considers to be the love of her life: she's back in town, finally ready to try to make things work.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">~~~</p>
<p>You can look forward to having a copy of <em>Accounting For It All</em> in your hands (and on your e-reader!) on <strong>November 19th, 2018.</strong></p>
<p>To stay up to date as more details come in, I encourage you to <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/newsletter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribe to my monthly newsletter</a>, <a href="http://www.twitter.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow me on Twitter</a> and <a href="http://www.facebook.com/iamrrcampbell" target="_blank" rel="noopener">my author page on Facebook</a>, check out my <a href="https://www.instagram.com/iamrrcampbell/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>, and <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/blog/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">keep an eye on my blog</a> as the months advance.</p>
<p>For more information on NineStar Press and the cornucopia of talented authors they've published to date, you can visit <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their website</a>, <a href="https://twitter.com/ninestarpress" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter feed</a>, <a href="https://www.facebook.com/ninestarpress" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook page</a>, and <a href="https://www.tumblr.com/blog/ninestarpress" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tumblr</a>.</p>
<p>A huge thank you to all of you for your support, and to NineStar Press for believing in this book.</p>
<p>I can't wait to share Robin's story with all of you.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
