    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p style="text-align: center;"><em>This is part fifteen of the misadventures of the <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/podcasts">Writescast</a> Raconteurs. For more on what this is and why it’s happening, feel free to check out the <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/writescast-raconteurs/">Writescast Raconteurs home page</a>.</em></p>
<h1>Scoreboard</h1>
<div id="attachment_4772" style="width: 976px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-4772" data-attachment-id="4772" data-permalink="https://ryanrcampbell.com/2017/12/12/writescast-raconteurs-climbing-one-rung-at-a-time/ladder-game-one/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/ladder-game-one.png?fit=966%2C492&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="966,492" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="ladder game one" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;THE POWER!!!&lt;/p&gt;
" data-medium-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/ladder-game-one.png?fit=300%2C153&amp;ssl=1" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/ladder-game-one.png?fit=966%2C492&amp;ssl=1" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-4772" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/ladder-game-one.png?resize=966%2C492&#038;ssl=1" alt="ladder game one" width="966" height="492" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/ladder-game-one.png?w=966&amp;ssl=1 966w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/ladder-game-one.png?resize=300%2C153&amp;ssl=1 300w" sizes="(max-width: 966px) 100vw, 966px" data-recalc-dims="1" /><p id="caption-attachment-4772" class="wp-caption-text">THE POWER!!!</p></div>
<p>Look. at. those. stats. Everyone on the squad bossed up in a big way this week, save for Rishard Matthews and Zuerlein, and no one could be upset with them considering how clutch they've otherwise been throughout the year.</p>
<p>What's great about this victory&#8212;aside from being the most points the team has scored all season&#8212;is that we're still in a great position to win back-to-back championships.</p>
<p>Of the consolation ladder.</p>
<p>For real, though, as I look at this team and how I'm expecting it to perform down the stretch, it's super frustrating to know we missed the playoffs by a single game. This team is like Hansel&#8212;so hot right now&#8212;and had we snuck into the playoffs, I'd be feeling great about our ability to win an actual, not-consolation-bracket championship.</p>
<p>If only I could roll this roster over into next year…</p>
<p>BUT THERE'S NO TIME TO THINK OF NEXT YEAR. We've got two more games to try to win ourselves a (consolation ladder) CHAMPIONSHIP.</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
