    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p style="text-align: center;"><em>This is part seven of the misadventures of the <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/podcasts">Writescast</a> Raconteurs. For more on what this is and why it’s happening, feel free to check out the <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/writescast-raconteurs/">Writescast Raconteurs home page</a>.</em></p>
<h1>Scoreboard</h1>
<div id="attachment_4446" style="width: 980px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-4446" data-attachment-id="4446" data-permalink="https://ryanrcampbell.com/scoreboard-2/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard-1.png?fit=970%2C514&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="970,514" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="scoreboard" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;TRASH&lt;/p&gt;
" data-medium-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard-1.png?fit=300%2C159&amp;ssl=1" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard-1.png?fit=970%2C514&amp;ssl=1" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-4446" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard-1.png?resize=970%2C514&#038;ssl=1" alt="scoreboard" width="970" height="514" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard-1.png?w=970&amp;ssl=1 970w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard-1.png?resize=300%2C159&amp;ssl=1 300w" sizes="(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px" data-recalc-dims="1" /><p id="caption-attachment-4446" class="wp-caption-text">TRASH</p></div>
<p>There was a modicum of hope going into the Sunday night game that I might be able to pull off an upset, but then, of course, the then-winless Giants kicked the Broncos in the teeth, and CJ Anderson laid a triceratops-sized egg.</p>
<p>Oddly enough, Isaiah Crowell did decently (relatively speaking), and the Vikings defense had a fantastic day against the now Aaron Rodgers-less Packers (as a Wisconsinite, this is a statewide tragedy). These performances plus that of my freshly picked up TE Austin Seferian-Jenkins give me some hope going forward, but I know that hope will ultimately be misplaced.</p>
<p>There's no way out. This is my fantasy football nightmare.</p>
<p>May the football gods prove themselves more merciful going forward.</p>
<hr />
<p>Want to cheer me up? Check out an episode of the writescast over at <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/podcasts" target="_blank" rel="noopener">this link.</a> If you *really* want to brighten my day, you can become a patron of the show (and cash in on great rewards) over at <a href="http://www.patreon.com/writescast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the writescast Patreon page.</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
