    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p style="text-align: center;"><em>This is part six of the misadventures of the <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/podcasts">Writescast</a> Raconteurs. For more on what this is and why it’s happening, feel free to check out the <a href="https://ryanrcampbell.com/writescast-raconteurs/">Writescast Raconteurs home page</a>.</em></p>
<h1>Scoreboard</h1>
<div id="attachment_4323" style="width: 980px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-4323" data-attachment-id="4323" data-permalink="https://ryanrcampbell.com/scoreboard/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard.png?fit=970%2C488&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="970,488" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="scoreboard" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;Let's not talk about it.&lt;/p&gt;
" data-medium-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard.png?fit=300%2C151&amp;ssl=1" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard.png?fit=970%2C488&amp;ssl=1" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-4323" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard.png?resize=970%2C488&#038;ssl=1" alt="scoreboard" width="970" height="488" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard.png?w=970&amp;ssl=1 970w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/scoreboard.png?resize=300%2C151&amp;ssl=1 300w" sizes="(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px" data-recalc-dims="1" /><p id="caption-attachment-4323" class="wp-caption-text">Let's not talk about it. Well, okay–maybe a little bit.</p></div>
<p>Pitiful. Just pitiful.</p>
<p>I actually had a chance this week after Tom Brady and Gillislee had an <em>Unfall</em> in their collective <em>Hose</em>. Then, in true Raconteurs fashion, we somehow managed to have an even greater <em>accidente</em> in our collective <em>pantalones</em>.</p>
<p>Undperformances from literally every member of the team save for the kicker and OBJ doomed us from the get-go.</p>
<p>But it only gets worse.</p>
<p>After already having lost a number of players to season-ending injuries earlier in the season, we lost our newfound TE Charles Clay for an indefinite amount of time due to a knee injury. Then, of course, we lost our best player and number one overall pick, OBJ, to a season-ending ankle injury.</p>
<p>That's it. There's no hope now. I don't even have anyone worth trading away to stack up at a single position.</p>
<p>If we manage to win a single game going forward, that will be more than I'd expect.</p>
<p><em>*sigh*</em></p>
<p>Better literal luck next year, I guess.</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
