    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>I want to thank everyone for their support of the writescast and hurricane relief during this unprecedented hurricane season.</p>
<p>Collectively, we raised $50 to support hurricane victims throughout Florida.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="4059" data-permalink="https://ryanrcampbell.com/screen-shot-2017-09-24-at-11-45-11-am/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/Screen-Shot-2017-09-24-at-11.45.11-AM.png?fit=605%2C521&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="605,521" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Screen Shot 2017-09-24 at 11.45.11 AM" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-medium-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/Screen-Shot-2017-09-24-at-11.45.11-AM.png?fit=300%2C258&amp;ssl=1" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/Screen-Shot-2017-09-24-at-11.45.11-AM.png?fit=605%2C521&amp;ssl=1" class=" size-full wp-image-4059 aligncenter" src="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/Screen-Shot-2017-09-24-at-11.45.11-AM.png?resize=605%2C521&#038;ssl=1" alt="Screen Shot 2017-09-24 at 11.45.11 AM" width="605" height="521" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/Screen-Shot-2017-09-24-at-11.45.11-AM.png?w=605&amp;ssl=1 605w, https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/Screen-Shot-2017-09-24-at-11.45.11-AM.png?resize=300%2C258&amp;ssl=1 300w" sizes="(max-width: 605px) 100vw, 605px" data-recalc-dims="1" /></p>
<p>Thanks again to everyone for their support. Write on, write well, and take care of one another.</p>
<hr />
<p>Miss the deadline to donate to hurricane support, but still want to contribute either to hurricane relief or the show directly?</p>
<p>Those devastated by hurricane Maria in Puerto Rico would love your support <a href="http://unidosporpuertorico.com/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here.</a> This initiative was created by Beatriz Rosselló, the first lady of the Puerto Rican territory.</p>
<p>To become a friend of the r. r. campbell writescast, <a href="https://www.patreon.com/writescast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">you can contribute here.</a></p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
