    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "As writers, setbacks are part of our experience. Whether in the form of a bad review, an outright rejection, or a day so packed with the tasks of day-to-day life that there's no time left to write, setbacks of any kind can become draining. Fortunately, there are strategies we can employ to beat back rejection […]",
