    "episode_featured_image": "/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/writescast-for-relief-1.png",
    "episode_player_image": "https://i0.wp.com/ryanrcampbell.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/2020-Writescast-Network-Logo.jpg?fit=3000%2C3000&ssl=1",
    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "As clean-up continues in both Texas and Florida, it's just as critical as ever that those most affected by these storms receive as much support as possible. That's why I've decided to extend the Writescast for Relief Campaign for one additional week. That is to say, from now until 11:59 p.m. CST on September 22, […]",
