    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>It's an exciting day for <a href="http://www.rrcampbellwrites.com/podcasts" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the writescast</a>! One of the show's first patrons, Brianna Kienitz, has just received her awesome writescast sticker for becoming a friend of the show over at <a href="http://www.patreon.com/writescast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the writescast Patreon</a>. She even found it a nice home!</p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true">
<p lang="en" dir="ltr">Thank you <a href="https://twitter.com/Writescast?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@writescast</a> for the bling! <a href="https://t.co/H8D2EdZW7t">pic.twitter.com/H8D2EdZW7t</a></p>
<p>&mdash; Brianna Kienitz - Friend of Mara🏳️‍🌈📚🔮 (@BeeKienitz) <a href="https://twitter.com/BeeKienitz/status/908017784835018752?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">September 13, 2017</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<p>A big thank you to Brianna for supporting the show. <a href="https://briannakienitz.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Be sure to support her</a> and her debut novel, <em>Off Pitch</em>, coming soon from <a href="https://ninestarpress.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ninestar Press!</a></p>
<p>Want your own writescast sticker or the ability to directly influence future topics of the show? You can earn rewards like these&#8212;and help unlock more episodes of the writescast each month&#8212;with a contribution of even $1 per episode over at <a href="http://www.patreon.com/writescast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the writescast Patreon.</a></p>
<p>Don't wait! Get in on the ground level and cash in on these rewards now to have as much influence as possible once the first listeners' choice polls go live!</p>
<p>Thanks for reading. Write on and write well.</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
