    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>It's 2017, which means there are more ways than ever to support the content and content creators we adore. To keep up with this trend, I'm proud to announce the writescast now has <a href="http://www.patreon.com/writescast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">its very own Patreon page!</a></p>
<p>What's Patreon, you ask? Patreon is the best way to show your love for the r. r. campbell writescast through direct support in the form of dollar-per-episode contributions.</p>
<p>In exchange for your patronage, I'm offering all sorts of great rewards, including&#8212;</p>
<ul>
<li>awesome 4&#8243; x 4&#8243; writescast stickers</li>
<li>influence on future topics of the show</li>
<li>votes in the annual Patrons' Choice Award given yearly to patrons' favorite episode</li>
<li><strong>the opportunity to help unlock as many as four writescast episodes per month</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>Sound awesome? Want to learn more? You can <a href="http://www.patreon.com/writescast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit the writescast Patreon page directly through this link</a>, or watch the video below.</p>
<p><span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe loading="lazy" class="youtube-player" width="1080" height="608" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GPFB6e0uYfo?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span></p>
<p>Thanks as always for reading, listening, and your support. Write on and write well.</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
