    "comment_status": "open",
    "content": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "<p>I'm pleased to announce that <em>Five:2:One Magazine</em> has published my flash fiction piece “Wool.” It is available in both text and audio format at <a href="http://five2onemagazine.com/wool-r-r-campbell-flash-fiction-thesideshow/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">this address</a>.</p>
<p>“Wool” is the story of a young boy's first and unexpected experience with poverty.</p>
<p>According to its About Us page, <em>Five:2:One</em> is dedicated to the transgressive, experimental, and the  progressive of the literary world. Aside from the magazine's #thesideshow series in which “Wool” has been posted, <em>Five:2:One</em> also publishes a quarterly print journal that features fiction, non-fiction, poetry, art, and more. You can learn more about <em>Five:2:One </em><a href="http://five2onemagazine.com/about-five-2-one-magazine/">here</a>.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<span class="et_bloom_bottom_trigger"></span>",
    },
    "date": "2017-07-28T13:15:58",
    "date_gmt": "2017-07-28T18:15:58",
