      "rendered": "Update: The date of publication for this piece has been pushed back to July 28th, 2017. I'm pleased to announce that Five:2:One Magazine will be publishing my flash fiction piece “Wool” on its website beginning July 7th, 2017 as part of its #thesideshow series for art, micro-poetry, and flash fiction. In addition to the text version of the […]",
