    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "A few weeks ago while trolling the Twitterwebs, I stumbled into a pitch game I hadn't heard of before: #SonofaPitch. I'd done in-person agent pitches for earlier projects, but never written a query letter. Having recently recently completed my manuscript for EMPATHY: Imminent Dawn, though, I figured I may as well give it a shot. Hoo-wee, […]",
    },
