      "rendered": "Anyone who has watched Spongebob Squarepants knows that Plankton's overall goal is to get a hold of the Krabby Patty formula by any means necessary, including the creation of a robot version of Mr. Krabs. Who could forget this classic scene? Though a formula (and love!) may be sufficient to approximate the taste of a Bikini-Bottom-renowned delicacy, […]",
