    "excerpt": {
      "protected": false,
      "rendered": "You may have heard of “the three Rs” way back in elementary school–reading, (w)riting, and (a)rithmetic. If you're anything like me, you completely disregarded the ‘rithmetic, which was a great decision because it created space for a third (and actual) “R.” And that “R,” my friends, is research. “Research,” you say? “That stuff's for nerds!” […]",
