    },
    "link": "https://ryanrcampbell.com/podcast/bb002/",
    "pubDate": "Fri, 23 Mar 2018 05:05:20 -0000",
    "subtitle": {
      "__prefix": "itunes",
      "__text": "In this Biblio Breakdown, we take a look at point of view, head hopping, and voice, all with the goal of developing a deeper understanding of how we can approach each of these in our own writing. To do this, we'll analyze Mohsin Hamid's Exit West. If",
    },
    "title": "Point of View, Head Hopping, and Voice - Biblio Breakdown 002",
  },
